# React: public values only. Supabase RLS protects private records.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-public-publishable-key
# Older projects may use VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY instead.

# Server configuration is set with `supabase secrets set`, never a VITE_ value.
# FARM_INTELLIGENCE_SYNC_SECRET: random secret of at least 32 characters.
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are provided to Edge Functions
# by Supabase. Do not copy a service-role key into this file or React.
# Existing reminder secrets are described in docs/advance-reminders-setup.md.
